---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';

// Quick Checklist — guest-facing, post-booking page recovered from the old
// WordPress site (hollidaylakehouse.com/quick-checklist/, page_id 576).
//
// Private by design: it is not linked from the nav/footer, is excluded from the
// sitemap (see astro.config.mjs), and renders with a `noindex` robots meta tag
// via the Base layout. Reachable only via a direct link, matching the same
// visibility rule the deleted /hlhid2604/ Guest Guidelines page followed.
//
// The recovered WordPress copy linked "HLH Guidelines" to
// myhlh.com/faq/guest-guidelines. Repointed to the current Guest Guidelines URL
// (myhlh.com/hlhid2604) per Stephen's confirmation — the faq path was stale.
const guidelinesUrl = 'https://myhlh.com/hlhid2604';
const googlePinUrl = 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/XXLDgRrYQX5iErQm7';
---

<Base
  title="Congratulations on your Holliday Lake House reservation!"
  description="A quick checklist to help you prepare for your stay at Holliday Lake House."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <header class="border-b border-bark-200 pb-8">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-700">
        Holliday Lake House
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl text-bark-800 sm:text-5xl">
        Congratulations on your Holliday Lake House reservation!
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-bark-600">
        Given the remote location and the natural environment, it's great to
        prepare accordingly. Here's a quick checklist to ensure you're well
        prepared for your stay:
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-bark-700">
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">1. Clothing</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Bring comfortable, older clothes that can get dirty or burs.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Waterproof boots or shoes for muddy terrain during the rainy season.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Layered clothing for varying weather conditions.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>A hat, sunscreen, and insect repellent if you're spending time outside during the summer.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">2. Outdoor Activities</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Depending on the season, you might want to bring gear for hiking, fishing, or wildlife watching.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Consider packing a small first aid kit for minor outdoor accidents.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>For cold weather, ensure you have warm clothing.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">3. Essentials</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Best to plan your major grocery shopping on your way in or as an excursion after your arrival (see below).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Cell coverage is spotty on the roads in and at the house.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Summers can get hot and there is no air conditioning. We have fans.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>There is a Valero Gas &amp; Mini Mart about 5 miles from the house.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">4. Getting There</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>
              The HLH address, 53600 Piute Rd, North Fork CA. 93643 only
              successfully maps with Google Maps. Other services have proven
              unreliable.{' '}
              <a
                href={googlePinUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="prose-link font-bold"
              >Link for Google Pin</a>.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Fresno, just over an hour away, is the nearest major city and airport.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Oakhurst, about 35 minutes, has 2 major supermarkets and other large retailers.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>North Fork is about 15 minutes and has a small market, gas station and a couple of very small retailers.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">5. Guidelines Review</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>
              Definitely take a look at the{' '}
              <a
                href={guidelinesUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="prose-link font-bold"
              >HLH Guidelines</a>{' '}
              to familiarize yourself with any house rules or specific
              instructions to make your stay comfortable and enjoyable.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">6. Gate Access</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>
              When you arrive at the gate, use the call box to select Directory
              and then select Onsite Manager to call the Caretaker for access.
              He will then meet you at the house for your Check-in and provide
              you with your gate code for your stay.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-bark-800">7. The Drive In — Trust the Road!</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Part of the magic of the Holliday Lake House is just how tucked away
          it is. When you turn onto the dirt road leading to the property, it
          may feel like you've taken a wrong turn — but you haven't! Keep going.
          That winding road through the trees is all part of the arrival
          experience, and we promise what's waiting at the end of it is
          absolutely worth it.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-bark-50 p-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-lg text-bark-700">
        Enjoy your trip to the Holliday Lake House!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
